cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use InstaNovo-FM, please cite the preprint below rather than this
  repository. The software entry exists so that citation tooling can resolve the
  code as well.
title: InstaNovo-FM
abstract: >-
  A self-supervised foundation model for proteomics tandem mass spectra. An
  encoder-only transformer trained to reconstruct masked regions of MS/MS spectra
  without peptide-sequence labels, whose frozen embeddings transfer across
  datasets, instruments and acquisition methods.
type: software
version: 0.1.0.dev0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/instadeepai/InstaNovo-FM
url: https://instadeepai.github.io/InstaNovo-FM
keywords:
  - proteomics
  - mass spectrometry
  - foundation model
  - self-supervised learning
  - de novo peptide sequencing
